<title>UK: Cypriot freighter hit by blaze in Indian Ocean.</title>
<headline>Cypriot freighter hit by blaze in Indian Ocean.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cypriot flag Global Natali, with a cargo of cotton, rice, chemicals and fire crackers, has reported a fire on board, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 17,659-dwt vessel is in the Indian Ocean and Seychelles port officials are investigating.</p>
